  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Culture Advisory Services II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Culture Advisory Services (CAS II) will increase the effectiveness of the programme for culture funded by the GPGC MIP II 2018-2020. The specific objective is the integration of new knowledge produced through the support measures in developing and ongoing programmes. The expected output of the support measures are increased knowledge and capacities of the actors involved in the implementation and management of the programmes.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
